WEBVTT

00:00:06.087 --> 00:00:08.813
<v><b>Patient:</b></v> So, what does it mean, Doctor?

00:00:11.408 --> 00:00:14.708
<v><b>Doctor:</b></v> Well, first the party.

00:00:15.089 --> 00:00:18.465
A party is a group of people.

00:00:18.925 --> 00:00:22.352
This means that you’re going to meet a lot of people.

00:00:22.804 --> 00:00:26.326
I think you’re going to be very busy.

00:00:27.818 --> 00:00:28.802
<v><b>Patient:</b></v> At work?

00:00:29.079 --> 00:00:34.023
<v><b>Doctor:</b></v> Yes, at work… you work in an office, I think?

00:00:34.468 --> 00:00:35.816
<v><b>Patient:</b></v> Yes, that’s right.

00:00:35.967 --> 00:00:42.732
<v><b>Doctor:</b></v> I think the party means you’re going to have lots of meetings.

00:00:46.049 --> 00:00:48.010
<v><b>Patient:</b></v> What about the champagne?

00:00:48.280 --> 00:00:49.938
<v><b>Doctor:</b></v> Let me look at my notes again.

00:01:03.421 --> 00:01:08.065
Champagne means a celebration. It’s a symbol of success.

00:01:08.850 --> 00:01:13.740
So we have a meeting or meetings and then a celebration.

00:01:15.065 --> 00:01:23.386
Maybe, in the future, you’ll have a meeting with your boss, about a possible promotion?

00:01:24.908 --> 00:01:28.329
<b>Patient:</b> Well, it’s possible. I hope so…

00:01:29.472 --> 00:01:33.392
What about the garden and the flowers? Do they mean anything?

00:01:33.749 --> 00:01:37.042
<v><b>Doctor:</b></v> Yes. Flowers are a positive symbol.

00:01:37.201 --> 00:01:42.545
So, the flowers mean that you are feeling positive about the future.

00:01:43.362 --> 00:01:49.043
So perhaps you already knew about this possible promotion?

00:01:49.979 --> 00:01:58.618
<v><b>Patient:</b></v> No, I didn’t. But it’s true, I am very happy at work and I feel very positive about my future.

00:01:58.643 --> 00:02:05.151
That’s not where my problems are. My problems are with my love life.

00:02:05.619 --> 00:02:08.157
Does my dream tell you anything about that?

00:02:08.601 --> 00:02:12.889
<v><b>Doctor:</b></v> Mm, yes it does.

00:02:15.634 --> 00:02:17.118
You’re single, aren’t you?

00:02:17.285 --> 00:02:20.094
<v><b>Patient:</b></v> Yes, well… divorced.

00:02:20.554 --> 00:02:26.760
<v><b>Doctor:</b></v> Because the violin music tells me you want some romance in your life –

00:02:27.625 --> 00:02:29.759
you’re looking for a partner, perhaps?

00:02:29.949 --> 00:02:35.195
<v><b>Patient:</b></v> Yes, yes, I am. In fact, I met a woman last month.

00:02:36.043 --> 00:02:37.365
 I really like her…

00:02:38.467 --> 00:02:39.814
I think I’m in love with her.

00:02:41.187 --> 00:02:42.451
 I’m meeting her tonight.

00:02:44.189 --> 00:02:48.291
<v><b>Doctor:</b></v> In your dream you saw an owl in a tree?

00:02:48.315 --> 00:02:50.315
<v><b>Patient:</b></v> Yes, an owl… a big owl.

00:02:51.021 --> 00:02:54.008
<v><b>Doctor:</b></v> The owl represents a wise person.

00:02:55.206 --> 00:02:59.480
I think you’ll need to ask this wise person for help.

00:03:00.694 --> 00:03:05.177
Maybe this ‘wise person’ is me?

00:03:06.978 --> 00:03:09.616
Maybe you need my help?

00:03:10.607 --> 00:03:19.976
<v><b>Patient:</b></v> Well, yes, what I want to know is, does this woman… love me?